@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor "Pool / PoolManager" as Caller

package "MemberDisk Domain（当前原型）" {
  component "MemberDiskClient\nsubmit / get / wait_idle" as Client
  component "Private ServiceMessage\nvariant + typed oneshot" as Message
  component "MemberDiskService::run\none root Tokio task" as Runtime
  component "Per-Disk Runtime Slot\nactive + pending event\nCancellationToken / IdleWaiters" as Slot
  component "FuturesUnordered\nadmission / query / reconciliation" as Futures
  component "MemberDiskService\ntransition rules / business actions\nfinish-state verification / commit_change" as Service
  database "HashMap<DiskUuid, MemberDisk>\ncommitted in-memory view" as Objects
}

component "MetadataService" as Metadata
database SDB
component "PoolNodeService" as Node
component "VirtualDiskService" as VD

Caller --> Client : explicit Pool target
Client --> Message : mpsc + oneshot
Message --> Runtime
Runtime --> Futures : poll all futures
Futures --> Service : validate disk ownership
Runtime --> Slot : admit / queue / cancel / repoll
Slot --> Futures : start one reconciliation
Futures --> Service : reconcile_once(object, active event)
Service --> Objects : query / apply committed update
Service --> Metadata : DiskUuid + MemberDiskUpdate
Metadata --> SDB : serial durable commit
Service --> Node : OpenDisk / SetDiskState
Service --> VD : has_references / evacuate
Futures --> Runtime : event / step finished
Runtime --> Client : accepted / query / idle result
Client ..> Runtime : all senders dropped = Drain
Caller ..> Runtime : JoinHandle::abort = force stop

note bottom of Runtime
运行循环不解释业务状态分支
事件槽和状态表属于MemberDiskService
一个根task并发poll多个Future
Drain等待Future收敛，业务不接收shutdown token
end note

note bottom of Slot
同一硬盘最多一个reconciliation Future
不同事件进入pending并触发CancellationToken
这里只保存事件与执行态，不复制MemberDisk业务状态
end note

note bottom of Service
start_state + event -> await action -> finish_state
action返回后验证权威结束状态
DOWN通知和停IO是同一个SetDiskState::Down动作
DOWN/UP保存在执行槽，Shrink意图持久化
end note
@enduml
